# onnxruntime-node (pulled in by @huggingface/transformers for local transcription tooling) tries to download Linux CUDA
# binaries during `npm ci`. The release asset now returns 404, which broke fresh installs on GitHub Actions and Cloudflare
# Pages. The site never uses those GPU binaries (speech runs in the browser), so skip that optional download.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
